<BaseLayout title="Companion Privacy | Kreativ Sound" description="Privacy information for the Kreativ Sound Companion browser extension." canonical="https://kreativsound.com/tools/kreativ-sound-companion/privacy/" activeNav="tools">
  <article class="card page-main policy-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Kreativ Sound Companion</p><h1 class="page-title">Extension privacy</h1><p class="page-lead">Last updated November 25, 2026.</p>
    <section><h2>What the extension does</h2><p>Kreativ Sound Companion calculates delay times, displays creative prompts, and offers links to Kreativ Sound. It is operated by Andrei Olaru. Contact <a href="mailto:info@kreativsound.com">info@kreativsound.com</a> with privacy questions.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Data and storage</h2><p>The extension saves your last valid tempo in its local browser storage to restore it when you reopen the popup. Calculations and prompts run locally. The extension does not transmit your tempo, collect browsing history, use analytics, or share data with Kreativ Sound or third parties. Clearing the extension’s browser storage or uninstalling it removes its saved tempo.</p><p>When you choose to copy a delay time, that value is written to your system clipboard. Other applications may be able to read the clipboard according to your operating system and browser settings.</p></section>
    <section><h2>External links</h2><p>If you open a link, your browser visits the Kreativ Sound website. That website operates separately and its <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> and analytics preferences apply.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
